{
  "_comment": "RAD06 (2026-10-18): helper-kld.json with R3_MOE_FP16=1 on the helper-on arm - output quality of the f16-WMMA MoE GEMM against the exact helper-off reference. Compare with docs/reference/engines/radiance/baselines/helper-kld.json. Set RAD_BIN, RAD_HOME and R9700_BDF before use. Not used by tests.",
